## Interface: 16001
## Title: BeastXP
## Notes: A small bar for your hunter pet's experience. Drag to move, drag the corner to resize, right-click or /petxp for the settings.
## Author: Florenzi
## Version: @project-version@
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Hunter_BeastTraining
## SavedVariables: BeastXPDB
## OptionalDeps: LibSharedMedia-3.0
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1735612

# BeastXP targets World of Warcraft: Forever only, whose toc is 16001.
# Check the live value in game with
#   /run print((select(4, GetBuildInfo())))
# before changing the line above, and change FOREVER_INTERFACE in
# BeastXP.lua with it.
#
# The settings are account-wide on purpose: the Forever client writes a
# per-character SavedVariables file but never loads it back.
#
# LibSharedMedia is not embedded. Any addon that registers textures or fonts
# loads it, and BeastXP looks it up only when a media list is wanted, so that
# media is listed whichever addon loaded it and whenever. OptionalDeps only
# puts a standalone LibSharedMedia ahead of BeastXP.

BeastXP.lua
BeastXP_Options.lua
